                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=460667'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li><li><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=25928930&name=DIR-HR-006-Duty-Statement-HearingReporterRev.07-2024MarinaDelRey.pdf'>Duty Statement</a></li></ul>

