        <div class="postingContent">
            <span style="font-size: 12pt;">Benefit information can be found on the <a href="https://www.calhr.ca.gov/Pages/California-State-Civil-Service-Employee-Benefits-Summary.aspx">CalHR</a> website and the <a href="https://www.calpers.ca.gov/">CalPERS</a> website.<br /></span><ul><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Health, Dental, and Vision Benefits</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Paid Sick and Vacation</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">11 Paid State Holidays</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Alternate/Modified Work Schedule</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">401(k), 457 and Roth IRA Plans</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Retirement (CalPERS)</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Employee Assistance Program (EAP)</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 4pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Medical and Dependent Care Reimbursement Accounts</span></li><li style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Pre-Tax Parking Program</span></li></ul>
